LOCATION:Mykonos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Major international LGBTQ+ summer festival drawing 30\,000+ visitors. Pool parties\, beach events\, headline DJs at Cavo Paradiso and other venues. Mykonos has been a leading gay summer destination since the 1970s\; XLSIOR is the most concentrated week of it. Expect rooms to be impossible.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/mykonos/#xlsior-mykonos-lgbtq-festival
