BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mykonos-diakofti-panigiri-of-agios-ioannis-theologos-diakofti-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270927
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Ioannis Theologos\, Diakofti
LOCATION:Diakofti\, Mykonos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hill chapel of Agios Ioannis at Diakofti celebrates the Theologian on 26 September (and again on 8 May) with a family-run panigiri: vespers\, then lamb\, wine and tsambouna music for whoever climbs up. September on Mykonos is when the old island reappears\, and this is a good place to see it.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/mykonos/#diakofti-panigiri-of-agios-ioannis-theologos-diakofti
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/mykonos/#diakofti-panigiri-of-agios-ioannis-theologos-diakofti
END:VEVENT
